{"event":"run_started","prompt":"Build a CLI expense splitter in Python (Click, JSON file storage, stdlib only). Requirements: (1) create a group with a name and a list of members; (2) add an expense to a group: who paid, the amount, an optional description, and which members it is split among (default all); (3) support equal splits and exact-share splits (each member's share given explicitly, must sum to the total); (4) list all expenses in a group with payer, amount, and participants; (5) compute each member's net balance (paid minus owed) and show who is up and who is down; (6) settle-up: output the minimal set of member-to-member payments that zeroes all balances; (7) delete an expense by id and edit an expense's amount; (8) export a group (members + expenses + balances) to JSON and to CSV via the stdlib csv module. Persist to a JSON file. Comprehensive pytest tests for splitting math, balances, and settle-up (Click CliRunner), and a README.","planner_model":"mihai-qwopus3.6-27b-coder-mtp","endpoint":"http://localhost:1234","working_dir":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-mihaiperdum-Projects/8508a6a6-9485-42a2-8f18-a56770b707c0/scratchpad/loop12/split","max_turns":40,"max_attempts":3,"pool":[{"id":"mac-gabee-qwopus3.6-27b-coder-mt","model_id":"gabee-qwopus3.6-27b-coder-mtp","weight":1,"instances":1},{"id":"local-mihai-qwopus3.6-27b-coder-mt","model_id":"mihai-qwopus3.6-27b-coder-mtp","weight":1,"instances":1},{"id":"worksmacstudio-qwopus3.6-27b-coder-mtp@q5_k","model_id":"qwopus3.6-27b-coder-mtp@q5_k_m","weight":1,"instances":1}],"ts":"2026-06-27T03:40:28.782825+00:00","run_id":"swarm-20260627-034028782","seq":0}
